  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring enchanting fairy tale castles, magical forests, mystical lanterns, fairies, and storybook elements.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom castle mugs, fantasy tumblers, water bottles, and storybook-themed home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for apparel, boutique branding, and magical gift items.   Custom apparel creation for fairytale t-shirts, cozy fantasy hoodies, canvas supply pouches, and custom everyday tote bags.   Fairytale-themed event decor, princess party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.",
